# ─── D-2 H2: release signing / publishing credentials ───────────────────────
# Additive deny rules. A signing key committed to this repository — which is
# intended to become public — is a total, unrecoverable compromise: the key
# cannot be rotated without forcing every user to uninstall and lose settings.
# These rules cover the ORDINARY add path only. They do NOT stop `git add -f`
# and they do NOT affect anything already tracked.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pfx
*.pem
*.der
*.key
*.pk8
*.kdbx
keystore/
signing.properties
keystore.properties
release-signing.properties
# Google Play publishing service-account keys — never commit.
play-service-account.json
play-store-credentials.json
*service-account*.json
